{#- 02 Cottonwood Square — paper ground, photo leads -#}
<section class="n-bg-paper" id="cottonwood" aria-labelledby="e2-h">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-block:clamp(28px,3.5vw,60px)">
<div class="n-entry n-entry--flip">
<span class="n-num" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,1.5rem + 1.6vw,3.25rem)">02</span>
<div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="e2-h" style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,1.4rem + 1.4vw,2.75rem);color:var(--n-evergreen)">Cottonwood Square</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:58ch">The second cluster of shops and everyday services, north-east of Old Town. Less historic, more practical, and where a lot of residents actually run errands. Two bronze bears sit on the corner.</p>
<dl style="margin:22px 0 0">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,.44fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(36,72,58,.22)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet">Getting there</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem">A short walk or a two-minute drive from Old Town. Lot parking.</dd>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,.44fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(36,72,58,.22)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet">Best for</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem">Lunch on a patio, and the practical errands.</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<a class="n-link" href="/eat-shop/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:18px">Browse by category <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
