{#- 03 Public art — white ground. No works are named: titles, artists and
    locations are not yet confirmed, and the page says so rather than guessing. -#}
<section class="n-bg-white" id="art" aria-labelledby="e3-h">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-block:clamp(28px,3.5vw,60px)">
<div class="n-entry">
<span class="n-num" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,1.5rem + 1.6vw,3.25rem)">03</span>
<div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="e3-h" style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,1.4rem + 1.4vw,2.75rem);color:var(--n-evergreen)">Public art</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:58ch">The steel gateway sculpture stands at the highway edge of the community, an oval sign held inside two curving rails. Further works are sited around the commercial blocks, close enough to see on the same walk.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:58ch;font-size:.9375rem">The Niwot Sculpture Park, run by the Niwot Cultural Arts Association since 2018, shows sculptures the association has bought or been given alongside pieces lent by artists for a year at a time, chosen by the park&#8217;s committee. The association&#8217;s site lists the current pieces.</p>
<dl style="margin:22px 0 0">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,.44fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--n-rule)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet">Sculpture park</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem"><a class="n-link" href="https://niwotarts.org/" rel="noopener">Niwot Cultural Arts Association <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></dd>
</div>
</dl>
<div class="n-callout n-callout--sky" style="margin-top:22px;padding:20px 22px;max-width:60ch">
<div class="n-label" style="color:var(--n-sky-ink)">Inventory in progress</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Individual works are listed here only with a verified title, artist and location, and that list is still being compiled. Send a verified entry and it goes in with artist credit.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="/plan-a-visit/#contact" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px">Contribute an entry <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
</div>
