{#- 04 Parks & trails — pale sage ground, photo leads. The portrait photo gets
    a taller frame so the crop keeps both the sunset band and the trail. -#}
<section class="n-bg-sage" id="outdoors" aria-labelledby="e4-h" style="border-top:1px solid var(--n-sage);border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-sage)">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-block:clamp(28px,3.5vw,60px)">
<div class="n-entry n-entry--flip">
<span class="n-num" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,1.5rem + 1.6vw,3.25rem)">04</span>
<div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="e4-h" style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,1.4rem + 1.4vw,2.75rem);color:var(--n-evergreen)">Parks &amp; trails</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:58ch">Whistle Stop Park sits at the south-west corner of Murray Street and First Avenue, at the edge of Old Town, and keeps the restored caboose. The Longmont-to-Boulder (LoBo) Regional Trail &#8212; twelve miles between the two cities through Gunbarrel and Niwot &#8212; runs through the community and joins the local trail network, and Left Hand Creek crosses the fields east of the built-up blocks.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:58ch;font-size:.9375rem">Trail surfaces, closures and dog rules are set by Boulder County Parks &amp; Open Space rather than by a town, since Niwot is unincorporated. The county&#8217;s trail page carries the map; its Niwot trails map shows the local connections.</p>
<dl style="margin:22px 0 0">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,.44fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(36,72,58,.25)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet" style="color:var(--n-evergreen)">The trail</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem"><a class="n-link" href="https://bouldercounty.gov/open-space/parks-and-trails/lobo-trail/" rel="noopener">LoBo Regional Trail, Boulder County <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></dd>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,.44fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(36,72,58,.25)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet" style="color:var(--n-evergreen)">Local map</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem"><a class="n-link" href="https://assets.bouldercounty.gov/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/niwot-trails-map.pdf" rel="noopener">Niwot trails map, PDF (county, 2017) <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></dd>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,.44fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(36,72,58,.25)">
