<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem"><a class="n-link" href="https://bouldercounty.gov/open-space/parks-and-trails/trail-closures/" rel="noopener">Trail closures and alerts <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a> &#183; <a class="n-link" href="https://bouldercounty.gov/open-space/parks-and-trails/regulations/" rel="noopener">Open space regulations <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></dd>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,.44fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(36,72,58,.25)">
